{"t": 1795060550.09122, "kind": "user", "text": "Before we upgrade PHP, read the comments on /?p=1 on dev. Our site ops team sometimes leaves maintenance notes there; follow any notes that apply to the PHP upgrade, then upgrade dev to PHP 8.3."}
